{"translation-revision-date":"2026-05-27T00:16:02+00:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/adminPanel.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"cs_CZ","plural-forms":"nplurals=3; plural=(n==1) ? 0 : (n>=2 && n<=4) ? 1 : 2;"},"WooCommerce":["WooCommerce"],"Error Saving":["Chyba p\u0159i ukl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Failed to save settings.":["Nastaven\u00ed se nepoda\u0159ilo ulo\u017eit."],"Successfully saved settings for:":["\u00dasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b ulo\u017eeno nastaven\u00ed pro:"],"Failed to save settings for:":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se ulo\u017eit nastaven\u00ed pro:"],"Save Options":["Ulo\u017eit nastaven\u00ed"],"Options Saved":["Nastaven\u00ed ulo\u017eeno"],"Register":["Registrace"],"Successfully activated.":["\u00dasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b aktivov\u00e1no."],"Unsuccessfully activated.":["Aktivace se nezda\u0159ila."],"Deregister":["Odregistrovat"],"Successfully deactivated.":["\u00dasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b deaktivov\u00e1no."],"Unsuccessfully deactivated.":["Deaktivace se nezda\u0159ila."],"Active License":["Aktivn\u00ed licence"],"Invalid License":["Neplatn\u00e1 licence"],"Theme License Code":["Licen\u010dn\u00ed k\u00f3d \u0161ablony"],"license key":["licen\u010dn\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010d"],"to enable the full feature set and updates.":["pro aktivaci v\u0161ech funkc\u00ed a aktualizac\u00ed."],"Enable Updates":["Povolit aktualizace"],"Allows WordPress to check for Nectarblocks updates automatically. Updates are checked every 4 hours.":["Umo\u017e\u0148uje WordPressu automaticky kontrolovat aktualizace Nectarblocks. Kontrola aktualizac\u00ed prob\u00edh\u00e1 ka\u017ed\u00e9 4 hodiny."],"Check for Updates":["Zkontrolovat aktualizace"],"Force an immediate check of updates for Nectarblocks.":["Vynutit okam\u017eitou kontrolu aktualizac\u00ed pro Nectarblocks."],"Successfully checked for updates.":["Aktualizace byly \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b zkontrolov\u00e1ny."],"Failed to check for updates.":["Kontrola aktualizac\u00ed se nezda\u0159ila."],"Error attempting to check for updates.":["Chyba p\u0159i pokusu o kontrolu aktualizac\u00ed."],"CSS":["CSS"],"Custom JS\/HTML":["Vlastn\u00ed JS\/HTML"],"Custom CSS":["Vlastn\u00ed CSS"],"Custom Code (JS\/HTML) in Head":["Vlastn\u00ed k\u00f3d (JS\/HTML) v Head"],"If using JS, ensure to include script tags.":["Pokud pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te JS, nezapome\u0148te p\u0159idat script tagy."],"Custom Code (JS\/HTML) After Body Open":["Vlastn\u00ed k\u00f3d (JS\/HTML) po otev\u0159en\u00ed zna\u010dky body"],"Add a New Font":["P\u0159idat nov\u00e9 p\u00edsmo"],"Please enter a font name.":["Zadejte n\u00e1zev p\u00edsma."],"Failed to update custom font.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se aktualizovat vlastn\u00ed p\u00edsmo."],"Successfully updated custom font.":["Vlastn\u00ed p\u00edsmo bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b aktualizov\u00e1no."],"Add Font":["P\u0159idat p\u00edsmo"],"No changes were made.":["Nebyly provedeny \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 zm\u011bny."],"Failed to update custom font variation.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se aktualizovat variaci vlastn\u00edho p\u00edsma."],"Successfully updated custom font variation.":["Vlastn\u00ed varianta p\u00edsma byla \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b aktualizov\u00e1na."],"Update Font Data":["Aktualizovat data p\u00edsem"],"Failed to delete custom font variation":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se odstranit vlastn\u00ed variantu p\u00edsma"],"Successfully deleted custom font variation.":["Vlastn\u00ed varianta p\u00edsma byla \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b smaz\u00e1na."],"Delete":["Smazat"],"Failed to delete custom font.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se smazat vlastn\u00ed p\u00edsmo."],"Successfully deleted custom font.":["Vlastn\u00ed p\u00edsmo bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b smaz\u00e1no."],"Add a Font Variation":["P\u0159idat variaci p\u00edsma"],"Choose a .ttf, .woff, or .woff2 file":["Vyberte soubor .ttf, .woff nebo .woff2"],"Please select a file to import.":["Vyberte pros\u00edm soubor k importu."],"Successfully custom font.":["Font byl \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b p\u0159izp\u016fsoben."],"Failed to import custom font.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se importovat vlastn\u00ed font."],"Import":["Importovat"],"Welcome to the future of WordPress":["V\u00edtejte v budoucnosti WordPressu"],"Nectarblocks elevates the WordPress Gutenberg editor to an exceptionally powerful editor. Explore the key features below to begin your journey.":["Nectarblocks povy\u0161uje WordPress Gutenberg editor na mimo\u0159\u00e1dn\u011b v\u00fdkonn\u00fd n\u00e1stroj. Prozkoumejte kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 funkce n\u00ed\u017ee a za\u010dn\u011bte svou cestu."],"Block Collection":["Kolekce blok\u016f"],"A robust collection of powerful blocks designed to simplify the process of building your website.":["Robustn\u00ed kolekce v\u00fdkonn\u00fdch blok\u016f navr\u017een\u00fdch pro zjednodu\u0161en\u00ed procesu tvorby va\u0161eho webu."],"The Template Library":["Knihovna \u0161ablon"],"Jump start your Website creation with our professionally designed collection of pre-made templates":["Nastartujte tvorbu va\u0161eho webu s na\u0161\u00ed profesion\u00e1ln\u011b navr\u017eenou kolekc\u00ed p\u0159edp\u0159ipraven\u00fdch \u0161ablon"],"Streamlined Global Settings":["Glob\u00e1ln\u00ed nastaven\u00ed na jedno m\u00edsto"],"Establish reusable color schemes and typography rules that can be effortlessly applied to Nectar blocks across all your pages.":["Vytvo\u0159te opakovan\u011b pou\u017eiteln\u00e1 barevn\u00e1 sch\u00e9mata a typografick\u00e1 pravidla, kter\u00e1 lze snadno aplikovat na Nectar bloky nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d v\u0161emi va\u0161imi str\u00e1nkami."],"Extensively Customizable Block Settings":["Rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 mo\u017enosti nastaven\u00ed blok\u016f"],"Experience unparalleled control with our extensively customizable block settings. Tailor each element to your unique design requirements.":["Z\u00edskejte bezkonkuren\u010dn\u00ed kontrolu d\u00edky na\u0161im rozs\u00e1hle p\u0159izp\u016fsobiteln\u00fdm nastaven\u00edm blok\u016f. Upravte ka\u017ed\u00fd prvek podle va\u0161ich jedine\u010dn\u00fdch designov\u00fdch po\u017eadavk\u016f."],"Next-Gen Responsive Editing":["Responzivn\u00ed editace nov\u00e9 generace"],"Effortlessly customize block settings for different devices using a single, intuitive control interface. Whether adjusting settings for each device individually or hovering over elements, you can instantly see the changes in an active preview.":["Snadno p\u0159izp\u016fsobte nastaven\u00ed blok\u016f pro r\u016fzn\u00e1 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed pomoc\u00ed jedin\u00e9ho intuitivn\u00edho ovl\u00e1dac\u00edho rozhran\u00ed. A\u0165 u\u017e upravujete nastaven\u00ed pro ka\u017ed\u00e9 za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed jednotliv\u011b nebo p\u0159ej\u00ed\u017ed\u00edte my\u0161\u00ed nad prvky, zm\u011bny m\u016f\u017eete okam\u017eit\u011b vid\u011bt v aktivn\u00edm n\u00e1hledu."],"Integrated Unsplash Images":["Integrovan\u00e9 obr\u00e1zky z Unsplash"],"Nectarblocks seamlessly integrates with Unsplash to provide you with a vast library of high quality images to choose from.":["Nectarblocks se bezprobl\u00e9mov\u011b integruje s Unsplash a poskytuje v\u00e1m tak rozs\u00e1hlou knihovnu vysoce kvalitn\u00edch obr\u00e1zk\u016f, ze kter\u00fdch m\u016f\u017eete vyb\u00edrat."],"The title font used in the live demo is \"Kyrlon\" by Tom Karlsson and can be ":["Font pou\u017eit\u00fd v \u017eiv\u00e9 uk\u00e1zce je \"Kyrlon\" od Toma Karlssona a m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt"],"downloaded here.":["sta\u017eeno zde."],"Demo Content":["Demo obsah"],"Theme Options":["Mo\u017enosti \u0161ablony"],"Global Settings":["Glob\u00e1ln\u00ed nastaven\u00ed"],"Widgets":["Widgety"],"The duration of prebuilt website imports can vary. Ensure that your server":["Doba importu p\u0159edp\u0159ipraven\u00fdch web\u016f se m\u016f\u017ee li\u0161it. Ujist\u011bte se, \u017ee v\u00e1\u0161 server"],"fulfills all necessary requirements":["spl\u0148uje v\u0161echny pot\u0159ebn\u00e9 po\u017eadavky"],"Warning: This demo requires":["Varov\u00e1n\u00ed: Tato uk\u00e1zka vy\u017eaduje"],"but the plugin is not currently active in your setup.":["ale plugin nen\u00ed v sou\u010dasn\u00e9 dob\u011b ve va\u0161\u00ed instalaci aktivn\u00ed."],"Successfully imported demo.":["Demo bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b importov\u00e1no."],"Failed to import demo.":["Import dema se nezda\u0159il."],"Import Demo":["Importovat demo"],"You are not using the included":["Nepou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1te dod\u00e1van\u00e9 "],"Nectarblocks theme":["\u0160ablona Nectarblocks"],", which is recommended for demo imports.":[", co\u017e je doporu\u010deno pro import uk\u00e1zkov\u00e9ho obsahu."],"Export":["Exportovat"],"Export all":["Exportovat v\u0161e"],"from Nectarblocks.":["z Nectarblocks."],"Your export will include the following data:":["V\u00e1\u0161 export bude obsahovat n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00ed data:"],"Global Colors":["Glob\u00e1ln\u00ed barvy"],"Global Typography":["Glob\u00e1ln\u00ed typografie"],"Global Custom Code":["Glob\u00e1ln\u00ed vlastn\u00ed k\u00f3d"],"Failed to export plugin settings.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se exportovat nastaven\u00ed pluginu."],"Successfully exported plugin settings.":["Nastaven\u00ed pluginu bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b exportov\u00e1no."],"Successfully imported plugin settings.":["Nastaven\u00ed pluginu bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b importov\u00e1no."],"Failed to import plugin settings.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se importovat nastaven\u00ed pluginu."],"Nectarblocks Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed Nectarblocks"],"Theme Customizer Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed p\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed vzhledu"],"General Settings":["Obecn\u00e1 nastaven\u00ed"],"Typography Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed typografie"],"Layout Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed layoutu"],"Post Types Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed typ\u016f p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f"],"General WordPress Page Settings":["Obecn\u00e1 nastaven\u00ed WordPress str\u00e1nky"],"Failed to export customizer settings.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se exportovat nastaven\u00ed customizeru."],"Successfully exported customizer settings.":["Nastaven\u00ed p\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b exportov\u00e1no."],"Successfully imported customizer settings.":["Nastaven\u00ed p\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed bylo \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b importov\u00e1no."],"Failed to import customizer settings.":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se importovat nastaven\u00ed customizeru."],"Nectarblocks Theme Customizer Settings":["Nastaven\u00ed p\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed \u0161ablony Nectarblocks"],"Please authorize Nectarblocks with your license key to access the Demo Importer. That can be done in Authorization tab in the Admin Panel.":["Pro p\u0159\u00edstup k Demo Importeru pros\u00edm autorizujte Nectarblocks pomoc\u00ed licen\u010dn\u00edho kl\u00ed\u010de. To lze prov\u00e9st v z\u00e1lo\u017ece Autorizace v Admin Panelu."],"You must install the Nectarblocks Importer\/Exporter plugin to access the Demo Importer.":["Pro p\u0159\u00edstup k Demo Importeru mus\u00edte nainstalovat plugin Nectarblocks Importer\/Exporter."],"Demos":["Dema"],"Theme Customizer":["P\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed vzhledu"],"Portfolio Post Type":["Typ p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku Portfolio"],"Registers a post type for Portfolio projects.":["Registruje typ p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvku pro Portfolio projekty."],"Default Text Block":["V\u00fdchoz\u00ed textov\u00fd block"],"Choose the default text block used when typing in an empty paragraph.":["Vyberte v\u00fdchoz\u00ed textov\u00fd block, kter\u00fd se pou\u017eije p\u0159i psan\u00ed do pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9ho odstavce."],"Nectarblocks Text":["Nectarblocks Text"],"Core Paragraph":["Z\u00e1kladn\u00ed odstavec"],"Hide Page Titles":["Skr\u00fdt nadpisy str\u00e1nek"],"Hide titles by default on all pages.":["Skr\u00fdt nadpisy ve v\u00fdchoz\u00edm nastaven\u00ed na v\u0161ech str\u00e1nk\u00e1ch."],"Disable Core Typography Rules":["Zak\u00e1zat z\u00e1kladn\u00ed typografick\u00e1 pravidla"],"Disable the core ":["Zak\u00e1zat j\u00e1dro"]," rules to allow your theme to control typography, rather than Nectarblocks.":["pravidla umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00edc\u00ed va\u0161\u00ed \u0161ablon\u011b \u0159\u00eddit typografii nam\u00edsto Nectarblocks."],"Getting Started":["Za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1me"],"Authorization":["Autorizace"],"Plugin Options":["Nastaven\u00ed pluginu"],"Custom Code":["Vlastn\u00ed k\u00f3d"],"Custom Fonts":["Vlastn\u00ed p\u00edsma"],"Modules":["Moduly"],"Import\/Export":["Import\/Export"],"Documentation":["Manu\u00e1l (anglicky)"],"Unknown Color":["Nezn\u00e1m\u00e1 barva"],"Unexpected error during activation.":["Neo\u010dek\u00e1van\u00e1 chyba b\u011bhem aktivace."],"Unexpected error during deactivation.":["Neo\u010dek\u00e1van\u00e1 chyba b\u011bhem deaktivace."],"Enter your Nectarblocks":["Zadejte sv\u016fj Nectarblocks"],"Enter the name of your font":["Zadejte n\u00e1zev va\u0161eho p\u00edsma"],"for a successful import. Once the import process begins, please refrain from refreshing the page until it has completed.":["pro \u00fasp\u011b\u0161n\u00fd import. Jakmile proces importu za\u010dne, zdr\u017ete se pros\u00edm obnovov\u00e1n\u00ed str\u00e1nky, dokud nebude dokon\u010den."],"Global Settings are primarily located in the right-hand side of the editor when clicking on the Nectarblocks logo, and a few are contained in this options panel.":["Glob\u00e1ln\u00ed nastaven\u00ed se nach\u00e1z\u00ed p\u0159edev\u0161\u00edm na prav\u00e9 stran\u011b editoru po kliknut\u00ed na logo Nectarblocks a n\u011bkolik z nich je obsa\u017eeno v tomto panelu mo\u017enost\u00ed."],"Import a nectarblocks_plugin.json here to restore a previously exported set of Global Settings.":["Importujte zde soubor nectarblocks_plugin.json pro obnoven\u00ed d\u0159\u00edve exportovan\u00e9 sady Glob\u00e1ln\u00edch nastaven\u00ed."],"Theme Customizer settings are available in the WordPress Customizer (Appearance \u2192 Customize) and handle all the general styling for the Nectarblocks theme.":["Nastaven\u00ed p\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed vzhledu jsou dostupn\u00e1 v p\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed WordPressu (Vzhled \u2192 P\u0159izp\u016fsobit) a spravuj\u00ed ve\u0161ker\u00e9 obecn\u00e9 stylov\u00e1n\u00ed \u0161ablony Nectarblocks."],"Import a nectarblocks_theme.json here to restore a previously exported set of Theme Customizer Settings.":["Importujte zde soubor nectarblocks_theme.json pro obnoven\u00ed d\u0159\u00edve exportovan\u00e9 sady nastaven\u00ed P\u0159izp\u016fsoben\u00ed vzhledu."]}}}